sn35.20:1.3 starts: “Whoever delights in sounds delights in stress…
sn35.20:1.4 starts: “Whoever delights in aromas delights in stress…
sn35.20:1.5 starts: “Whoever delights in flavors delights in stress…
sn35.20:1.7 starts: “Monks, whoever delights in ideas delights in stress.
sn35.20:2.3 starts: “Whoever doesn’t delight in sounds doesn’t delight in stress…
sn35.20:2.4 starts: “Whoever doesn’t delight in aromas doesn’t delight in stress…
sn35.20:2.5 starts: “Whoever doesn’t delight in flavors doesn’t delight in stress…
sn35.20:2.7 starts: “Monks, whoever doesn’t delight in ideas doesn’t delight in stress.
